  "story": {
    "day": 76,
    "title": "Kaya's Bali Adventure",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya visited Bali, Indonesia, a beautiful island.",
      "She saw many tall bamboo trees there.",
      "They hiked a kilometer to a deep lake.",
      "Climbing Mt. Batur, a mountain, was exciting.",
      "Kaya got a headache and sat on a bench.",
      "Her young mother offered a cup of warm soup.",
      "Her father, an office worker, wanted to spend more time.",
      "That night, they went to a beach party.",
      "Kaya watched a volleyball game and a wedding.",
      "She put her camera in its case.",
      "The floor markings helped them come home after they got off the bus.",
      "Back in her kitchen, Kaya did not run. \"Travel is my favorite subject!\""
    ]
  }
